<!-- Atlas procurement feed for the atl-nova source (django_atlas xml_feed connector).
     Served by the zeno `fixtures` container as
       http://fixtures:8000/package/source-feeds/atlas-nova-v1.xml

     EAN namespace 5902… is reserved for atlas (supplier feeds own 59012341000xx,
     the suppliers anchor owns 5900000000017).

     Post-seed roles (statuses set by scripts/seed-atlas-workload.py):
       ATL-N001  auto-match: EAN + weight equal to anchor ATL-ANCHOR-1        -> pushed
       ATL-N002  auto-match: EAN of anchor ATL-ANCHOR-2, weight within 10%   -> pushed
       ATL-N003  EAN of anchor ATL-ANCHOR-3, weight 5x off -> tolerance
                 violation event + fresh per-source RealProduct              -> pushed
       ATL-N004  plain push; workload bumps data_changed_at afterwards       -> pushed (Updated tab)
       ATL-N005..N009  review queue (Swipe default filter); N009 is out of stock -> queued
       ATL-N010, N011  untouched fresh imports (N011 has no EAN)             -> new
       ATL-N012  rejected by the workload script (no EAN)                    -> rejected

     No <images> on purpose: image-less pushes land straight at `pushed`
     (pushed_pending_images would depend on the async image pipeline). -->
